### Create V1 shipment
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/shipping/v1/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{}}

